---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Case Studies"
description: "How Abatec has delivered for clients including Kier and Balfour Beatty across major infrastructure and engineering programmes."
---
<header class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="{{ '/' | url }}">Home</a> / <a href="{{ '/for-clients/' | url }}">For Clients</a> / Case Studies</p>
    <span class="eyebrow">Case Studies</span>
    <h1>Delivery, under pressure, at scale.</h1>
    <p>A selection of briefs where the timeline was tight, the requirements were specialist, and the margin for error was zero.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    {% for study in caseStudies %}
    <article class="case-study" id="{{ study.slug }}">
      <div class="case-study__figure">{{ study.client }}</div>
      <div>
        <div class="case-study__tags">
          <span class="tag tag--amber">{{ study.client }}</span>
          {% for tag in study.tags %}<span class="tag">{{ tag }}</span>{% endfor %}
        </div>
        <h2>{{ study.title }}</h2>
        <p><strong>The challenge:</strong> {{ study.challenge }}</p>
        <p><strong>Our approach:</strong> {{ study.approach }}</p>
        <p><strong>The result:</strong> {{ study.result }}</p>
        <div class="case-study__metrics">
          {% for metric in study.metrics %}
          <div><strong>{{ metric.value }}</strong><span>{{ metric.label }}</span></div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section--slate">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band">
      <div>
        <h2>Want results like these on your next programme?</h2>
        <p>Tell us about your brief and we'll come back with a delivery plan, not just a promise.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">Request a consultation</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
